Welcome to CH Future Predictor AI 🚀

CH Future Predictor AI is a smart prediction application designed to analyze data and provide possible future predictions using AI and prediction logic.

✨ Features

- 🔮 Future prediction
- 📊 Data analysis
- 📈 Probability calculation
- 🎯 Prediction confidence
- ⚡ Fast results
- 💻 Simple and user-friendly interface
- 🌐 Web-based application

🧠 How to Use

1. Open CH Future Predictor AI.
2. Select the prediction type.
3. Enter your data.
4. Click Make Prediction.
5. View the prediction result and probability.

